VERDICT: PASS -- the authored objective and the authored topology are both satisfied and
the authored step measured 10 of 10 and then 30 of 30. The proof is counted traffic at a
far-side host NIC with an in-leg control that must not arrive, plus the PIM-DM-specific
control messages decoded on the transit wire; the table reads only corroborate.
      baseline, pdmd RUNNING but no config .. joined receiver, 0 of 10; control 10/10
