      State Refresh ........................ `PIMv2, Prune Refresh, length 36` from the
                                             DUT, repeatedly, on the transit wire
      upstream prune ....................... `PIMv2, Join / Prune, length 34` from sw1
      GRAFT ................................ unicast Graft from sw1 and the unicast
                                             Graft Acknowledgement 206 us later, turning
