04:09:55.736500 IP 10.0.61.1 > 10.0.61.2  : PIMv2, Graft Acknowledgement, length 34
04:09:57.738881 IP 10.0.61.1 > 224.0.0.13 : PIMv2, Prune Refresh, length 36

